      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Following extraction of a symptomatic mandibular premolar which had been subjected to two periradicular surgical procedures, significant apical healing was identified histologically. The implications of these findings are discussed in relation to contemporary advocated treatment regimens, case assessment, and interpretation for success and failure."},
